sequenceDiagram
    title Checkout
    autonumber
    actor U as Shopper
    participant W as Web App
    participant P as Payments
    participant S as Stock
    U->>+W: Place order
    W->>W: Validate cart
    par Reserve and charge
        W->>S: Reserve items
        S-->>W: Reserved
    and
        W->>+P: Charge card
        alt Approved
            P-->>W: Receipt
        else Declined
            P--xW: Error
            opt Retry once
                W-)P: Charge again
            end
        end
        deactivate P
    end
    critical Confirm
        W-->>U: Order confirmed
    option Timeout
        W--)U: Email later
    end
    Note right of S: Ships in 2 days
    Note over U,W: Session ends
    W-->>-U: Done
